 # UnderWeb X changelog
 
+## 0.4.5-rc5 — OSC polish pass
+
+- Reworked OSC Lab into a cleaner live-status workspace.
+- Removed avatar-parameter controls from the user-facing OSC page.
+- Added a reorderable output stack so users can choose chatbox block priority.
+- Added a connection-health panel for VRChat OSC, media, world sync, Pulsoid, and broadcast state.
+- Refined spacing, hierarchy, status surfaces, and responsive behavior.
+- Kept avatar OSC sender support under the hood for future internal use.
+
 ## 0.4.4-rc4 — Live media timeline
 
 - Added real Windows media-session position and duration to Now Playing.
